          "ruleId": "CWE-306",
          "ruleIndex": 1,
          "level": "error",
          "message": {
            "text": "Workflow webhook trigger ignores generated secret — unauthenticated workflow execution\n\nThe public webhook trigger endpoint `POST /v1/webhook/:webhookId/trigger` never verifies the per-webhook secret. A secret is generated and its hash stored on creation, but the trigger path ignores it entirely, so any caller who knows a webhook ID can execute the workflow with attacker-chosen variables, without any signature or shared secret."
          },
          "locations": [
